    "title": "Suspect taken into custody in fatal shooting at Belknap Road - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carrie Gloeckner Rose ,\n16 hours ago A suspect wanted in connection with the fatal shooting of a man at 10055 Belknap Road on June 6 was taken into custody. Axzey Mojica, 22, has been charged with murder in Fort Bend County, according to a news statement from the Houston Police Department (HPD). Another suspect, 23-year-old Iddris Umaru, died from a self-inflicted gunshot wound as police attempted to arrest him. Umaru has also been charged with murder in Fort Bend County. Read full article\n3",
